      "Summary": {
        "Namespace": "",
        "Key": "4E0E67B44A3C3A557F7542A7236EB454",
        "SourceString": "The Black Tusker is lurking deep in the swamps. Garrik said the ground turns black, the air stinks of rot, and the place goes dead silent when you're close, but I don’t think that’s the case. Maybe it’s just an overgrown boar. I will handle it with no issue. I need to track it down and kill it before it causes more damage.",
